        "file": "lib/keeper/keeper_run_prompt.ml",
        "line": 69,
        "fact": "Post-tool request assembly filters blocks through injected_on_post_tool_round."
      },
      {
        "file": "lib/types/prompt_block_id.ml",
        "line": 87,
        "fact": "Dynamic_context is excluded on post-tool rounds."
      },
      {
        "file": "packages/agent_core/lib/agent/agent_turn.ml",
        "line": 44,
        "fact": "Extra context is a request carrier; the documented non-Anthropic path does not retain it as ordinary conversation history."
      }
    ],
    "observed_failure": "The exact synthetic A source completed and ACKed without its required A1 note. GLM searched the right tool names, then listed notes for two unrelated schedule IDs and finished.",
    "repair_direction": "Preserve the exact admitted scheduled request as attributed durable conversation/work input, tied to its source/instance lifecycle. Keep ordinary changing world observations separate. Thinking preservation is not a replacement for durable work input.",
    "causality_limit": "The source loss mechanism and missing final-snapshot work input are confirmed. The run does not isolate this as the sole cause of model-generated wrong IDs; initial wire delivery remains unproven."
